 * k 1 / 2 by their own cores, k 3..6 by the hybrid R2 seed and one register prefix step (sbn3f_rsqrt_prefix23..26); k 6 at
 * s 61..63 and k 7..10 by a tail jump to sbn3f_rsqrt_rsp_k7 (rsqrt_rsp.S, generated by tools/generate_fp_rsqrt_rsp.py); k 11..512
 * by a tail jump to sbn3f_rsqrt_qv (rsqrt_qv.S, the IFMA driver; its engine rsqrt_engine.S, generated by
 * tools/generate_fp_rsqrt_engine.py), which stops at ud2 for k > 512. Also the hidden seed entry sbn3f_rsqrt_seed (ns 5..8
 * limbs; ns 7 / 8 by a tail jump to sbn3f_rsqrt_rsp_seed) that the driver calls.
 * Maintained source, not regenerated: the research kernel G's scalar.S (experiments/results/fpk_2026-10-12/rsqrt_s4x/joint/
 * x512g_claude, OVH2-RSQRT, accepted by the owner 2026-10-16) with the library's symbol names, this header and two .hidden
 * declarations; its machine code is scalar.o's. G's scalar.S was the last of a chain of edits of Codex's scalar-v3 / v4 (the
 * lines below, newest first; the edit scripts are in the research repository: ovh2_rsqrt/tools/mkscalar_g.py, fix_rsqrt/tools/
 * mkscalar_r2.py and mkscalar_u.py, slim_rsqrt/tools/mkscalar_f.py, applied to joint/x512cs_claude/scalar.S).
 * Notices: LGPL-3.0-or-later. The k 1 / 2 cores come from a donor that carries the GMP notice (GMP 6.3.0 arithmetic, dual
 * LGPLv3+ / GPLv2+; Copyright 1991-2016 Free Software Foundation, Inc.; notice src/core/x86_64/scalar-donor-notice.txt); the
 * prefix steps' 3-limb square carry schedule is adapted from tools/generate_fp_inv.py's sq3 (project donor notices: the same
 * file; the prefix steps' own line further below).
 * Research history (verbatim; paths relative to experiments/results/fpk_2026-10-12/rsqrt_s4x/joint, fpkrs_ = sbn3f_rsqrt_):
 *   OVH2-RSQRT (2026-10-16): k 6 s 61..63 to rsp's 2 -> 4 -> 7; every route one final prefix step; Codex's generic step machinery (53 labels) removed (ovh2_rsqrt/tools/mkscalar_g.py).
 *   j14: scalar-v4 + unchanged Claude P-first k7..10; dead scalar blocks pruned.
 *   FIX-RSQRT (2026-10-16): R2 v3 (gen_r2_hybrid.emit_core_v3, the FP part emit_fp_v3 at the public entry, fix_rsqrt/tools/mkscalar_r2.py).
 *   FIX-RSQRT (2026-10-16): every k > 10 to the unified driver sbn3f_rsqrt_qv (fix_rsqrt/tools/mkscalar_u.py).
 *   SLIM-RSQRT (2026-10-16): seeds ns 7 / 8 tail-jump to rsp's seed entry; the 3 -> 7/8 seed step and its routes removed (slim_rsqrt/tools/mkscalar_f.py).
 *   RSP delegation prune: public k<=6 + seed5..8; generic m4,n6 only.
 *   scalar-v4 stage2 raw_k6; original hybrid R2; unchanged ABI.
 *   k6 final prefix26: s1..60, bias36; existing s0/high-s routes retained.
 *   Scalar-v3, LGPL-3.0-or-later. k1/k2 donor carries GMP notice; see src/core/x86_64/scalar-donor-notice.txt.
 */
